OL,3,GNEWSAFire service and museum to hold
OL,4,Asummer open day
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey Fire and Rescue Service (SFRS)
OL,7,Fis to hold its summer open day this
OL,8,Fweekend.
OL,10,FSFRS described the day, which raises
OL,11,Ffunds for the Fire Fighters Charity, as
OL,12,Fa "great opportunity" to learn about
OL,13,Ffirefighters' work, watch live
OL,14,Fdemonstrations, meet crews and see the
OL,15,Fengines.
OL,17,FThere will also be a chance to visit
OL,18,FSurrey Fire Museum, which houses a
OL,19,Flarge collection of firefighting
OL,20,Fartefacts from across the centuries.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
