OL,3,GNEWSAFire service and museum to hold
OL,4,Asummer open day
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe museum is managed and run by The
OL,7,FFire Brigades of Surrey Preservation
OL,8,FTrust, a charity established in the
OL,9,F1980s to preserve the history of the
OL,10,Fservice in the county.
